<title>SWEDEN: Swedish July industrial production falls 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish July industrial production falls 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production fell 4.5 percent in July for a year on year increase of 1.7 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
